(2.5) Normal Distribution (PDF Module)
This is a modular presentation of lesson on The Normal Distribution which  
is considered the most widely known and used of all distributions. Because  
the normal distribution approximates many natural phenomena so well, it has  
developed into a standard of reference for many probability problems.
